FoamFile { version 2.0; format ascii; class dictionary; object fvSolution; }
// VMFL046-R6 -- rhoCentralFoam (density-based) fvSolution.  REPLACES R5's PIMPLE block:
// rhoCentralFoam has NO pressure-velocity coupling loop (no PIMPLE, no nOuter/nCorr, no
// pressure equation), so there is no residualControl and no relaxation -- the conserved
// variables (rho, rhoU, rhoE) are advanced EXPLICITLY (a diagonal "solve"), and only the
// diffusive parts of U and e are solved implicitly.  This is the standard rhoCentralFoam
// solver set (matching the OpenFOAM v2606 laminar viscous tutorial LadenburgJet60psi).
//
// NOTE, for the record: the absence of any PIMPLE outer/inner iteration is exactly why R6
// is the successor to R4's hunt -- R4's limit cycle (R3 §5.3: 85.4 % of the log-residual
// variance in one ~4168-iteration mode) was a mode OF the pressure-based iteration, which
// this solver does not perform.
solvers
{
    "(rho|rhoU|rhoE)"
    {
        solver          diagonal;
    }

    U
    {
        solver          smoothSolver;
        smoother        GaussSeidel;
        nSweeps         2;
        tolerance       1e-10;
        relTol          0;
    }

    e
    {
        $U;
        tolerance       1e-10;
        relTol          0;
    }
}
